```http
### 1. Login successfully as John (expect 200)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=johndoe&password=secret

### 2. Get current active user (expect 200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer johndoe

### 3. Login with incorrect password (expect 400)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=johndoe&password=wrong

### 4. Login as Alice (expect 200)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=alice&password=secret2

### 5. Access disabled Alice's account (expect 400)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer alice

### 6. Access with an unknown user token (expect 401)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer unknown
```